            "title": "Madison for Privacy",
            "summary": "What are Automatic License Plate Readers (ALPRs)? Automated License Plate Readers (ALPRs) are cameras that capture a series of high resolution images every time a vehicle drives by them. These images are analyzed with AI software to create a digital fingerprint of each vehicle, allowing them&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p> </p>\n<p class=\"align-center\"><span style=\"color: #02192b; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 1.80203em; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.54px;\">What are Automatic License Plate Readers (ALPRs)?</span></p>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pp9MwZkHiMQ?t=110s\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<main class=\"mb-16\">\n<div class=\"v-container v-locale--is-ltr\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\">\n<div class=\"video-responsive text-center\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\"> </div>\n<p data-v-96f5d941=\"\">Automated License Plate Readers (ALPRs) are cameras that capture<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> a series of high resolution images <strong>every time a vehicle drives by them</strong>. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These images are analyzed with AI software to create a digital fingerprint of each vehicle, allowing them to be searched not just by their license plate number but by the make, model, color, and any unique features like bumper stickers or roof racks. </span></p>\n<p data-v-96f5d941=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Over time, this data is used to create a <strong>searchable record of every vehicle’s movement patterns</strong>. This record does not just stay within our local Madison County Sheriff Department, it is <strong>shared across a nationwide database</strong> that thousands of agencies have access to.   </span></p>\n<p data-v-96f5d941=\"\">These cameras collect data on all of our of vehicles <strong data-v-96f5d941=\"\">regardless of whether the driver is suspected of a crime</strong>. These systems are marketed as indispensable tools to fight crime, but they ignore the powerful tools police already have to track criminals, such as cell phone location data, <strong data-v-96f5d941=\"\">creating a loophole that doesn't require a warrant</strong>.</p>\n<hr class=\"v-divider v-theme--dark my-12\" role=\"separator\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-8\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\"> What do they look like?</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"mb-16 text-center\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\"><figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/flock-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-xs.jpg 640w ,https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-sm.jpg 768w ,https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-md.jpg 1024w ,https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-lg.jpg 1366w ,https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-xl.jpg 1600w ,https://www.madisonforprivacy.org/media/posts/1/responsive/flock-1-2xl.jpg 1920w\"></figure></div>\n<hr class=\"v-divider v-theme--dark my-12\" role=\"separator\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\">\n<h2>Why Should You Be Concerned</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-8 text-center\">ALPRs invade your privacy and violate your civil liberties. Here's how:</p>\n<details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Are a Major Security Risk</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 12px; color: white;\">\n<p>Modern ALPR systems collect and store license plate data from every passing vehicle, creating huge databases of sensitive information that can be misused if breached or abused.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2013/05/alpr\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">EFF: ALPR Surveillance Explained</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aclu.org/news/privacy-technology/alpr-as-public-data\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">ACLU: License Plate Readers and Privacy</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Do Not Reduce Crime</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>Studies show that ALPRs have little effect on reducing crime. They primarily gather license plate data without addressing underlying causes.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.brookings.edu/research/alpr-and-public-safety/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">Brookings: ALPR and Public Safety</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Are Dragnet Surveillance</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>ALPRs track every passing vehicle, creating a massive database of movements without suspicion of wrongdoing.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aclu.org/issues/privacy-technology/location-tracking/alpr-license-plate-readers\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">ACLU: Dragnet ALPR Surveillance</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Are Abused</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>Without strict oversight, law enforcement can misuse ALPR data for unrelated investigations or personal tracking.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2013/05/alpr-surveillance-explained\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">EFF: ALPR Abuse Examples</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPR Usage Leads to Dangerous Police Encounters</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>Tracking vehicles can escalate routine stops into dangerous encounters, especially if misidentifications occur.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cato.org/publications/commentary/alpr-risks-police-encounters\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">Cato Institute: ALPR and Police Risk</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Result in Racist Policing</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>ALPRs can disproportionately target marginalized communities, reinforcing systemic biases in law enforcement.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.naacp.org/resources/alpr-impact-on-communities-of-color/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">NAACP: ALPR and Racial Bias</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details><details style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<summary class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">ALPRs Put Undocumented People at Risk</summary>\n<div style=\"background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 15px; color: white;\">\n<p>ALPRs can expose undocumented people to immigration enforcement, increasing fear and risk in everyday life.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aclu.org/issues/immigrants-rights/technology-and-immigrants\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff;\" rel=\"noopener\">ACLU: Technology Risks for Immigrants</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details></div>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><hr class=\"v-divider v-theme--dark my-12\" role=\"separator\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-8\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panels v-theme--dark v-expansion-panels--variant-default\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Are ALPRs a necessary tool for police?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Why should I care if I have nothing to hide?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Do these cameras only record vehicles involved in crimes?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Do police need a warrant to search these cameras?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">What oversight is there for these systems?</button></div>\n<div id=\"faq-transparency\" class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Do Flock's transparency portals give a full picture of who has access to the data?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Can Flock be trusted to keep our data safe?</button></div>\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-expansion-panel__shadow\"> </div>\n<button class=\"v-expansion-panel-title font-weight-bold\" type=\"button\" data-v-1cf1abf3=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">How can I get these cameras out of my city/town?</button></div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"v-divider v-theme--dark my-12\" role=\"separator\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\">\n<div id=\"similar\" class=\"v-container v-locale--is-ltr similar-projects py-12\" data-v-6a7ecefa=\"\" data-v-96f5d941=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-row justify-center mb-8\" data-v-6a7ecefa=\"\">\n<div class=\"v-col-md-8 v-col-12\" data-v-6a7ecefa=\"\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</main>",
